The real Developer ID build found a second portability issue: macOS Bash 3.2 treats an empty array expansion as unbound under `set -u`. That gate failed with exit code 1 after compilation, before signing. I’m removing the empty-array pattern entirely and using explicit keyed/unkeyed branches, then rerunning the signed build.
