+| `SIGN_IDENTITY='Developer ID Application: Relux Works, LLC (262RZ595FP)' REQUIRE_DEVELOPER_ID=1 VERSION=v0.2.0 scripts/build-app.sh` | 0 | Universal hardened-runtime Developer ID app built and verified. |
