+# TASK-260728-d2mm8v release prerequisite audit
+
+Date: 2026-07-28
+
+## Repository target
+
+- `origin` fetch/push URL: `git@github.com:relux-works/relux-proxy.git`
+- No GitLab remote is configured.
+- No `CI_*`, `GITLAB*`, `GLAB*`, `RELUX*`, `ASC_*`, `MACOS_*`, or
+  `DEVELOPER_*` environment variable is present.
+- Repository, parent-story, and task metadata do not name a Relux GitLab
+  hostname, namespace, project path, or project ID.
+
+## GitLab authorization
+
+- `glab auth status` exit code: 1.
+- `gitlab.com`: API request returned HTTP 401; no token was found.
+- `gitlab.wildberries.ru`: a credential exists, but that instance is explicitly
+  excluded by TASK-260728-d2mm8v and was not queried or mutated beyond the
+  local `glab auth status` report.
+- Explicit SSH probes to `git@gitlab.com` with the Relux bot key and the
+  personal project key both returned `Permission denied (publickey)` with exit
+  code 255.
+
+## Apple release identity
+
+- The login keychain contains
+  `Developer ID Application: Relux Works, LLC (262RZ595FP)`.
+- No notarization or CI certificate-secret variable is present in the process
+  environment. Secret values were not searched for, printed, or copied.
+
+## Mutation decision
+
+No GitLab push, mirror, tag, package upload, or Release mutation is authorized
+until a human supplies and confirms the Relux-owned hostname, full namespace
+and project path, authorization route, accepted commit SHA, protected macOS
+runner, and protected release credentials. The authenticated Wildberries
+instance must not be used.
